{"articleNo":"1618","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=1618&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"교내성적장학생 선발 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2011.02.25","hit":"12512","attachments":[{"name":"장학금지급지침(13차개정-최종)4.hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=1618&attachNo=70472"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<!--StartFragment-->&nbsp;\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 15pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: ’한컴돋움’\">&lt;&nbsp;교내성적장학생 선발 안내 &gt;</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 42pt; TEXT-INDENT: -42pt\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; COLOR: #ff0000; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: ’한컴돋움’\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;※ 성적장학생(금오, 우등, 준우등)은 공인 외국어 성적표를 </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 42pt; TEXT-INDENT: -42pt\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; COLOR: #ff0000; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: ’한컴돋움’\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;반드시 제출하여야 장학금 수혜 대상자로 선정될 수 있습니다. </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 42pt; TEXT-INDENT: -42pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; COLOR: #282828; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: ’한컴돋움’\">&nbsp;1) 금오 및 우등장학금</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 42pt; TEXT-INDENT: -42pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; COLOR: #282828; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: ’한컴돋움’\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;금오 및 우등장학생은 직전학기 성적과 학년별 최저 공인 외국어 시험성적을</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 42pt; TEXT-INDENT: -42pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; COLOR: #282828; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: ’한컴돋움’\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;다음과 같이 적용한다.</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 36.7pt; TEXT-INDENT: -36.7pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; COLOR: #282828; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: ’한컴돋움’; LETTER-SPACING: 0.4pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;∘ 2011학년도 1학기 기준으로 2학년 500점, 3학년 550점, 4학년 600점이상 취득한 자.</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 36.7pt; TEXT-INDENT: -36.7pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; COLOR: #282828; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: ’한컴돋움’; LETTER-SPACING: 0.4pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;∘ 2011학년도 1학기 기준으로 1학년만 공인 외국어 성적을 반영하지 않는다.<br><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 36.7pt; TEXT-INDENT: -36.7pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: ’한컴돋움’; LETTER-SPACING: 0.4pt\"></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 42pt; TEXT-INDENT: -42pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; COLOR: #282828; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: ’한컴돋움’\">&nbsp;2) 준우등장학금 </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 42pt; TEXT-INDENT: -42pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; COLOR: #282828; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: ’한컴돋움’\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; COLOR: #282828; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: ’한컴돋움’; LETTER-SPACING: 0.4pt\">∘</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; COLOR: #282828; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: ’한컴돋움’\">준우등장학생은 직전학기성적 70%+공인 외국어 성적 30%를 환산하여 합산 한다.</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 42pt; TEXT-INDENT: -42pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; COLOR: #282828; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: ’한컴돋움’\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; COLOR: #282828; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: ’한컴돋움’; LETTER-SPACING: 0.4pt\">∘2011년 1학기 기준으로 2학년은 모의토익 시험성적을 인정한다.</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 41.9pt; TEXT-INDENT: -41.9pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; COLOR: #282828; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: ’한컴돋움’; LETTER-SPACING: 0.1pt\">&nbsp;3) 공인외국어 시험성적 적용기준은 해당학기 시작일(6.1, 12.1)부터 1년이내의 공인</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 41.9pt; TEXT-INDENT: -41.9pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; COLOR: #282828; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: ’한컴돋움’; LETTER-SPACING: 0.1pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;외국어 시험성적표을 제출하여야 한다.</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 41.9pt; TEXT-INDENT: -41.9pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; COLOR: #282828; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: ’한컴돋움’; LETTER-SPACING: 0.1pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;- 2011년 1학기 성적장학금은 2009. 12. 01 ~ 2010. 11. 30이내의 성적을 기준으로 한다.&nbsp;<br></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; COLOR: #282828; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: ’한컴돋움’; LETTER-SPACING: 0.1pt\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 41.9pt; TEXT-INDENT: -41.9pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; COLOR: #282828; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: ’한컴돋움’; LETTER-SPACING: 0.1pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;※ 문의 : 054-478-7065(학생처 본관 101호)<br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 41.9pt; TEXT-INDENT: -41.9pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; COLOR: #282828; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: ’한컴돋움’; LETTER-SPACING: 0.1pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; COLOR: #282828; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: ’한컴돋움’; LETTER-SPACING: 0.1pt\">붙임&nbsp; 교내성적장학생 선발 안내 1부.&nbsp; 끝.</span><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 41.9pt; TEXT-INDENT: -41.9pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; COLOR: #282828; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: ’한컴돋움’; LETTER-SPACING: 0.1pt\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 41.9pt; TEXT-INDENT: -41.9pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; COLOR: #282828; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: ’한컴돋움’; LETTER-SPACING: 0.1pt\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 41.9pt; TEXT-INDENT: -41.9pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; COLOR: #282828; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: ’한컴돋움’; LETTER-SPACING: 0.1pt\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 41.9pt; TEXT-INDENT: -41.9pt; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 15pt; COLOR: #282828; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: ’한컴돋움’; LETTER-SPACING: 0.2pt\">2011. 02. 25</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 41.9pt; TEXT-INDENT: -41.9pt; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 15pt; COLOR: #282828; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: ’한컴돋움’; LETTER-SPACING: 0.2pt\">학생처</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: ’한컴바탕’\"><br></span></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
